ile_name": "6.png", "id": "565672503230653", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_565672506563986_1356329606340217386_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vNqzQg3B0eUQ7kNvwFuddys&_nc_oc=AdqPjjyGsDKuUw0MGlj3AZQxyGVxSP9_wnwa-betDIZRSi5JAm6rbQ_MUTDh1yGmmhQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHp_NefdwloijGYb4yqccLVH7x-yMbRQfsmqIwNQeXidw&oe=6A82F473"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1702624157353147", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_1702624160686480_922416495192464725_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6WJZuaEkwaEQ7kNvwGJTcgB&_nc_oc=AdrU6S4E2Uwk9-ELZP9QFQP7GVfrlbDUU2hYrHkCvnedIv7HCWG_pt-gIwUWis2MZ5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGwrYwRc_gEm52Tim7KF4Szwk1W1QtLd-z9FBbeKmfIJw&oe=6A82E2A7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Smash Court Master - Tennis Game", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Smash Court Master VR, the ultimate virtual reality tennis experience that puts you right in the action! Whether you\u2019re a seasoned pro or a newcomer to the sport, this immersive game allows you to step onto the court and experience the thrill of tennis like never before.\n\nIn Smash Court Master VR, you\u2019ll face off against intelligent AI opponents or challenge your friends in exciting multiplayer matches. Master your serves, volleys, and powerful smashes as you refine your skills to dominate the competition. With realistic physics and intuitive controls, every shot feels authentic, making you feel like a real tennis champion.\n\nExplore various courts, from grass to clay, and unlock a variety of gear and customization options to enhance your gameplay. With dynamic challenges and engaging gameplay modes, Smash Court Master VR offers endless fun and competition. Are you ready to smash your way to victory and claim your title as the ultimate Smash Court Master?", "s